# The random item reward: exactly one of 25 items is a strong one, and no item comes twice.
# Profile LocalLow/Just2D/Drova/Sprint_24_A (a copy of Sprint_24). Override the save with -D hero=N -D slot=N.

default hero 5
default slot 0

launch A
A wait ready=1 timeout=240
A wait saves=separate timeout=1
A load $hero $slot
A wait world=1 timeout=240

A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward RandomItem contains True timeout=1
